    {
      "id": "c04",
      "phan": "giai-thich",
      "toc_do": 0.95,
      "loi": "Why do we do this? Part of the answer goes back to 1979, when Daniel Kahneman and Amos Tversky published prospect theory.",
      "loi_doc": "Why do we do this? Part of the answer goes back to nineteen seventy-nine, when Daniel Kahneman and Amos Tversky published prospect theory.",
